WEBVTT

00:19.440 --> 00:20.370
Would immortals

00:21.160 --> 00:22.670
like bullets?

01:33.509 --> 01:35.170
I really didn't misjudge you.

01:37.060 --> 01:38.590
You're no ordinary person.

01:48.870 --> 01:49.789
Adjutant Mo.

01:51.009 --> 01:52.270
As for your dying wish,

01:53.280 --> 01:54.610
I'll fulfill it for you.

02:09.220 --> 02:12.080
"Wait until the three adjutants
all meet their end,

02:12.900 --> 02:16.500
and even a single defeat
could still accomplish the grand plan."

02:16.579 --> 02:18.250
This third adjutant

02:20.310 --> 02:22.170
actually turned out to be myself.

02:22.340 --> 02:24.340
"Could accomplish the grand plan"—

02:25.840 --> 02:28.450
so I was just a pawn too.

02:31.970 --> 02:33.360
How ridiculous.

02:34.370 --> 02:36.280
How absurd.

02:40.910 --> 02:42.710
Everything was wrong all along.

07:00.550 --> 07:06.710
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

07:07.070 --> 07:09.670
[Episode 31]

07:18.880 --> 07:19.940
Zhang Haixia!

07:21.770 --> 07:22.800
Zhang Haixia!

07:32.690 --> 07:33.500
Help me...

07:35.540 --> 07:36.810
Help me...

07:42.570 --> 07:43.630
Help me...

07:44.740 --> 07:45.930
Please...

07:46.740 --> 07:48.450
Please save us.

07:49.500 --> 07:50.750
Immortal.

07:54.240 --> 07:55.120
I'll do my best.

07:56.100 --> 07:57.560
The rest is up to your fate.

08:27.370 --> 08:29.700
I'm retired and still can't get any peace.

08:30.170 --> 08:31.960
Those two little brats—

08:45.900 --> 08:48.430
all grown up
yet still won't let me worry less.

09:21.910 --> 09:22.940
We're saved!

09:22.940 --> 09:23.690
We're saved!

09:23.770 --> 09:24.580
We're saved!

09:24.580 --> 09:27.320
Feikun Balu saved us once again!

09:28.390 --> 09:29.420
He saved us!

10:01.770 --> 10:02.650
Mentor.

10:13.980 --> 10:15.310
You wretched disciple.

10:18.210 --> 10:21.410
Do you really think what you burned
was the real medicine?

10:54.870 --> 10:56.400
This isn't what I intended.

10:57.020 --> 10:59.620
And it's also the outcome
I least wanted to see.

11:00.610 --> 11:01.490
Mentor.

11:02.170 --> 11:03.570
I also want to go to Balai.

11:05.870 --> 11:07.470
Have you thought it through?

11:08.370 --> 11:09.240
I have.

11:13.750 --> 11:15.880
You've been this way since childhood,

11:16.480 --> 11:18.890
always keeping
everything bottled up inside.

11:18.890 --> 11:21.890
You need to think about yourself too,
not just others.

11:23.400 --> 11:24.780
I was raised by you.

11:26.600 --> 11:27.840
Aren't you the same?

11:35.200 --> 11:36.530
If killing me

11:37.510 --> 11:38.710
would bring you pain,

11:40.860 --> 11:43.460
then I'd rather die on the way
to kill Mo Yungao.

11:45.720 --> 11:46.720
Just treat it as

11:48.000 --> 11:49.730
me being willful one last time.

11:51.230 --> 11:52.420
Do as you please.

12:39.200 --> 12:39.860
Mentor.

13:02.640 --> 13:03.330
Mentor.

14:03.730 --> 14:05.270
This is great!

14:29.050 --> 14:30.180
Let's go take a look.

14:44.050 --> 14:45.240
Mentor...

14:59.340 --> 15:02.930
[2 days later]

16:16.920 --> 16:18.250
Let's give him some time

16:18.800 --> 16:20.660
to be alone with my mentor's wife.

16:44.390 --> 16:50.450
♪ Truth or lie, seasons pass
in fleeting years ♪

16:51.540 --> 16:57.450
♪ A silent breeze
brushes past that lingering warmth ♪

16:56.270 --> 16:59.050
Thank you, Feikun Balu!

16:58.810 --> 17:04.619
♪ In this fleeting world,
I long for a moment of vivid life ♪

16:59.290 --> 17:01.740
Thank you, Feikun Balu!

17:02.340 --> 17:04.970
Thank you, Feikun Balu!

17:05.750 --> 17:08.200
Thank you, Feikun Balu!

17:06.050 --> 17:10.280
♪ I may have a chance to open a door ♪

17:08.619 --> 17:11.109
Thank you, Feikun Balu!

17:11.670 --> 17:18.240
♪ Where love and wish
meet in a fleeting moment ♪

17:12.220 --> 17:15.010
Thank you, Feikun Balu!

17:15.140 --> 17:17.589
Thank you, Feikun Balu!

17:18.140 --> 17:20.619
Thank you, Feikun Balu!

17:19.190 --> 17:25.230
♪ There's no need to ask questions
in the maze ♪

17:20.900 --> 17:23.520
Thank you, Feikun Balu!

17:23.660 --> 17:25.880
Thank you, Feikun Balu!

17:26.040 --> 17:28.280
♪ The world's bustle ♪

17:26.530 --> 17:28.900
Thank you, Feikun Balu!

17:29.030 --> 17:33.740
♪ Can briefly warm
those under a shared roof ♪

17:29.380 --> 17:31.850
Thank you, Feikun Balu!

17:34.880 --> 17:40.160
♪ And the story has come to an end ♪

17:41.200 --> 17:47.780
♪ Gifted to us the luck to walk
side by side a stretch of way ♪

17:48.060 --> 17:54.530
♪ After partings and meetings,
spring breeze comes round tomorrow ♪

17:55.130 --> 17:57.360
♪ The world's bustle ♪

17:58.010 --> 18:03.360
♪ Can keep whose dream under the roof? ♪

18:04.260 --> 18:14.690
♪ No farewell wishes needed in this life ♪

18:56.010 --> 18:57.030
What's going on?

18:57.050 --> 18:58.340
Why is he here?

18:59.720 --> 19:00.680
No idea.

19:02.350 --> 19:03.090
Everyone,

19:04.300 --> 19:05.960
we need to keep moving forward

19:06.480 --> 19:08.280
and complete the final mission.

19:08.320 --> 19:09.300
Where to?

19:10.970 --> 19:13.230
To fulfill your Commander's dying wish.

19:13.380 --> 19:14.740
Commander's already dead.

19:14.740 --> 19:16.140
You're not our adjutant.

19:16.160 --> 19:18.090
We don't have to follow his orders!

19:21.660 --> 19:22.460
You should know

19:22.460 --> 19:24.560
how Mo Yungao became the Commander—

19:25.720 --> 19:28.920
because he discovered the secrets
deep within Nanqiang.

19:31.280 --> 19:33.300
I can take you even deeper.

19:34.840 --> 19:37.100
As for who will become the next Mo Yungao,

19:39.330 --> 19:41.370
it's up to you.

19:49.130 --> 19:50.360
Let's go.

19:51.530 --> 19:52.330
That's right.

19:52.840 --> 19:54.240
I saw a group of warlords.

19:54.310 --> 19:56.040
They are in Nanqiang right now.

19:56.700 --> 19:57.460
Buddies,

19:57.590 --> 19:58.840
to protect Nanqiang,

19:59.110 --> 20:00.380
we have to kill them.

20:00.790 --> 20:01.510
-Yes.
-That's right.

20:01.510 --> 20:02.000
You're right.

20:02.000 --> 20:02.850
Kill them!

20:02.850 --> 20:03.400
Kill them!

20:03.400 --> 20:03.880
Kill them!

20:03.880 --> 20:04.480
Kill them!

20:04.550 --> 20:05.180
Kill them!

20:05.180 --> 20:07.040
That friend of Master Feikun Balu

20:07.180 --> 20:08.400
seems to be among them too,

20:08.400 --> 20:09.530
named Zhang Haixia.

20:09.720 --> 20:10.750
What friend?

20:11.240 --> 20:12.830
He's that officer's second-in-command.

20:12.830 --> 20:13.420
That kind of scum

20:13.420 --> 20:14.790
is not Mr. Zhang's friend.

20:14.790 --> 20:16.200
Then let's invite that "immortal"

20:16.200 --> 20:17.140
to come with us.

20:17.610 --> 20:19.220
Who the hell are you?

20:20.200 --> 20:21.730
Aren't you Mo Yungao's man?

20:22.570 --> 20:24.030
When did you sneak in here?

20:28.090 --> 20:29.470
Mr. Zhang saved me.

20:29.980 --> 20:31.980
I have forsaken darkness for light.

20:34.310 --> 20:37.040
Back then, Mo Yungao sought me out
to go to Nanyang

20:37.660 --> 20:41.250
because my family has raised snakes
in Bailejing for generations.

20:41.250 --> 20:44.670
Mo Yungao had been researching
the black-haired snake,

20:45.100 --> 20:48.030
and he needed a consultant
who could control snakes.

20:48.770 --> 20:50.900
We heard about this from Zhang Hailou.

20:51.610 --> 20:53.050
So the Evil God of Nanyang

20:53.190 --> 20:56.650
was something you guys were orchestrating
behind the scenes.

20:56.680 --> 20:57.850
I was forced.

20:57.850 --> 20:59.290
If I didn't cooperate,

20:59.660 --> 21:01.190
he would have killed me too.

21:02.960 --> 21:03.960
Then tell me,

21:05.250 --> 21:07.180
how did you make the Evil God speak?

21:09.380 --> 21:11.580
T-This kind of snake is like a myna bird.

21:11.720 --> 21:13.720
It can mimic human speech by nature.

21:15.720 --> 21:16.720
Alright. Enough.

21:17.010 --> 21:18.510
That person you wanted to invite just now—

21:18.510 --> 21:19.710
he's not an immortal.

21:20.940 --> 21:22.340
His name is Zhang Hailou.

21:25.250 --> 21:27.340
Have you seen Zhang Hailou?

21:27.680 --> 21:28.310
No.

21:28.830 --> 21:30.890
He's not in the mourning hall either.

22:24.790 --> 22:26.570
Although I know you won't listen,

22:26.570 --> 22:28.510
I still advise you not to go
looking for him.

22:28.510 --> 22:30.920
If something really is wrong
with Zhang Haixia,

22:30.920 --> 22:32.610
or even worse—if he has done evil—

22:32.610 --> 22:33.570
then you'll have to face the situation

22:33.570 --> 22:36.160
of whether you must kill him
with your own hands.

22:36.160 --> 22:38.090
I don't think you'd be able to do it.

22:39.140 --> 22:40.460
Didn't you say that no matter what he did,

22:40.460 --> 22:41.380
you would forgive him,

22:41.380 --> 22:42.050
clean up his mess for him,

22:42.050 --> 22:43.070
and take him home?

22:44.880 --> 22:46.790
Don't even think about
looking for Zhang Haixia.

22:46.790 --> 22:48.440
He's no longer the person he used to be.

22:48.440 --> 22:50.410
If you can't realize this,

22:50.530 --> 22:52.730
then it's better for you two not to meet.

23:35.790 --> 23:36.650
Macabre Masks—

23:37.510 --> 23:39.270
it's a tradition of the Zhang family.

23:39.270 --> 23:40.460
The older generation of the Zhang family,

23:40.460 --> 23:42.330
when they needed to carry out
elimination of evil,

23:42.330 --> 23:44.300
assassinations, or raids,

23:44.510 --> 23:46.840
would wear masks designed by themselves.

23:47.420 --> 23:48.530
These masks

23:48.530 --> 23:50.050
are not like human-skin masks

23:50.050 --> 23:51.470
and cannot be used for disguise.

23:51.470 --> 23:53.310
They are only meant to cover the face

23:53.310 --> 23:55.040
and intimidate the opponents.

23:55.090 --> 23:56.790
The Zhang family
really has a lot of rules.

23:56.790 --> 23:59.070
Is it necessary
to intimidate the opponents?

23:59.070 --> 24:01.530
The opponents we face
are all very powerful,

24:02.030 --> 24:02.740
so the masks

24:02.740 --> 24:03.850
are usually made to reflect

24:03.850 --> 24:05.660
the forms people fear most.

24:31.610 --> 24:34.090
We've been searching for ages
and still can't find him.

24:34.090 --> 24:35.820
Where on earth did Mr. Zhang go?

24:37.420 --> 24:40.440
Mentor's wife's body is still lying
in the ancestral hall.

24:40.440 --> 24:41.740
In the depths of Bailejing,

24:41.740 --> 24:43.530
remnants of the Mo faction
are still active.

24:43.530 --> 24:44.990
If we still can't find him,

24:45.460 --> 24:46.920
I will bury Mentor's wife.

24:46.940 --> 24:48.200
I'll handle it myself.

24:49.050 --> 24:50.250
Who's coming with me?

24:56.030 --> 24:57.770
But Zhang Haixia is still there.

24:57.770 --> 24:59.770
He's indeed difficult to deal with.

24:59.830 --> 25:01.490
Only Mr. Zhang knows him best.

25:01.700 --> 25:04.430
Where are the Mo faction remnants
you mentioned?

25:07.250 --> 25:08.120
Are you okay?

25:08.740 --> 25:09.290
I'm fine.

25:10.140 --> 25:10.960
Just tell me directly

25:10.960 --> 25:11.960
where the Mo faction remnants are.

25:11.960 --> 25:12.760
Zhang Hailou,

25:13.270 --> 25:14.530
you helped me avenge my deep grudge

25:14.530 --> 25:15.730
and saved Bailejing.

25:15.790 --> 25:16.880
Whatever you want to do,

25:16.880 --> 25:19.010
I'll definitely do my best to help you.

25:19.140 --> 25:19.770
Me too.

25:20.250 --> 25:22.510
My buddies and I are all at your disposal.

25:22.770 --> 25:23.560
Thank you.

25:23.770 --> 25:25.100
Regarding Zhang Haixia

25:25.220 --> 25:26.960
and those remnants of the Mo faction,

25:26.960 --> 25:28.290
we've found some clues.

25:29.930 --> 25:33.520
[Feikun Palu Temple]

25:32.330 --> 25:33.320
A few days ago,

25:33.440 --> 25:35.180
someone saw remnants of the Mo faction

25:35.180 --> 25:37.180
appear near the Feikun Balu Temple,

25:37.270 --> 25:38.800
but they soon disappeared.

25:39.070 --> 25:40.150
So I guess

25:40.350 --> 25:42.740
there's a deeper space
under the Feikun Balu Temple,

25:42.740 --> 25:44.520
and it's related to the Zhang family.

25:44.520 --> 25:45.280
But

25:45.570 --> 25:47.170
we don't know where it leads.

26:07.770 --> 26:08.570
Zhang Hailou.

26:09.220 --> 26:10.580
If we find Zhang Haixia,

26:11.160 --> 26:12.360
what do you plan to do?

26:12.590 --> 26:13.650
Kill him.

27:00.610 --> 27:02.660
This should be the place
built by the Zhang family ancestors

27:02.660 --> 27:04.420
to make medicine.

27:05.880 --> 27:08.420
There are also
some ancient books and documents.

27:08.420 --> 27:09.680
They must be quite old.

27:10.880 --> 27:14.010
These probably date back to
the Xia and Shang dynasties.

27:19.290 --> 27:21.220
So this is where Mentor used to come

27:21.570 --> 27:22.500
to gather herbs.

27:23.500 --> 27:25.160
It's just that all those herbs

27:25.480 --> 27:26.680
have been destroyed.

27:26.810 --> 27:27.590
What herbs?

27:28.000 --> 27:29.730
The herbs to cure Zhang Haixia.

27:31.750 --> 27:33.880
He's no longer the person he used to be.

27:36.290 --> 27:37.820
There are some things here.

27:39.030 --> 27:40.490
They look freshly burned.

27:43.200 --> 27:44.530
Why would Zhang Haixia

27:44.660 --> 27:46.450
go out of his way to burn these?

27:50.350 --> 27:51.480
Let's keep chasing.

28:24.640 --> 28:26.700
Are we going deep into the mountains?

28:28.070 --> 28:28.880
Big Pot.

28:29.960 --> 28:32.150
You seem very afraid of
going into the mountains.

28:32.150 --> 28:33.330
It's not that I'm afraid.

28:33.330 --> 28:34.420
When I was racing horses back then,

28:34.420 --> 28:36.140
I once heard a legend from an old man

28:36.140 --> 28:37.330
in Nanqiang.

28:37.720 --> 28:38.440
Legend has it

28:38.440 --> 28:40.590
that deep in the mountains of Nanqiang,

28:40.590 --> 28:42.420
there lives a terrifying monster

28:42.420 --> 28:43.400
called Atianre.

28:43.900 --> 28:45.070
This Atianre

28:45.160 --> 28:46.940
was later defeated by the Mountain God.

28:46.940 --> 28:49.010
After the Mountain God killed Atianre,

28:49.010 --> 28:50.010
he set a rule

28:50.140 --> 28:51.570
that no descendant of Nanqiang

28:51.570 --> 28:53.000
is allowed to enter the mountains.

28:53.000 --> 28:54.730
Because once someone enters,

28:54.790 --> 28:56.740
it will awaken the slumbering Atianre,

28:56.740 --> 28:59.140
and the entire Nanqiang will be destroyed.

28:59.530 --> 29:00.720
You said it yourself

29:00.720 --> 29:01.940
that it's a legend.

29:02.500 --> 29:03.610
I'm just curious—

29:04.290 --> 29:05.790
what exactly is Zhang Haixia

29:05.790 --> 29:07.070
going in there to do?

29:08.530 --> 29:09.990
It can't be anything good.

29:10.160 --> 29:12.290
I won't sleep soundly until I kill him.

30:36.510 --> 30:38.370
The footprints have been erased.

30:38.410 --> 30:39.660
Which way did they go?

30:42.530 --> 30:43.160
This way.

30:46.750 --> 30:48.410
There are inscriptions here.

30:50.720 --> 30:51.290
These inscriptions

30:51.290 --> 30:53.160
correspond to the danger of this crevice.

30:53.160 --> 30:54.420
Many of these crevices

30:54.550 --> 30:56.280
were probably set up by people.

30:56.980 --> 30:58.040
They look very old.

30:58.090 --> 30:59.160
Do you recognize

30:59.660 --> 31:00.860
these inscriptions?

31:01.480 --> 31:03.790
Back when we were under
the Southern Archives,

31:03.790 --> 31:05.330
there were similar crevices.

31:05.330 --> 31:06.990
They were all man-made traps,

31:07.070 --> 31:08.440
each one unpredictable

31:08.550 --> 31:09.750
and extremely dangerous.

31:09.750 --> 31:11.850
It was the defense mechanism
of the Southern Archives.

31:11.850 --> 31:13.250
Now that I think about it,

31:13.480 --> 31:14.590
it seems the Zhang family's ancestors

31:14.590 --> 31:16.390
explored these places long ago,

31:16.500 --> 31:18.030
then returned to the Archives

31:18.030 --> 31:20.490
and adopted these mechanisms
for use later.

31:21.380 --> 31:22.460
These characters

31:22.750 --> 31:25.750
look like oracle bone script
or bronze inscriptions,

31:26.070 --> 31:27.530
but I'm not entirely sure.

31:28.290 --> 31:30.440
They seem to be from the Xia-Shang period—

31:30.440 --> 31:31.460
possibly a very rare writing system

31:31.460 --> 31:33.350
used by one of the Baiyue tribes.

31:33.610 --> 31:35.350
You're actually pretty cultured, huh?

31:35.350 --> 31:36.750
What kind of talk is that?

31:36.750 --> 31:37.640
I was a horse racer, okay?

31:37.640 --> 31:38.640
I've seen plenty.

31:40.500 --> 31:43.110
But why did Zhang Haixia have to come here

31:43.420 --> 31:45.020
to wipe away his footprints?

31:45.810 --> 31:46.640
Zhang Haixia,

31:47.250 --> 31:48.710
what exactly are you up to?

31:49.790 --> 31:50.660
Where are you?

31:52.840 --> 31:54.240
There's something here.

32:00.050 --> 32:00.980
[Heaven's Secret]

32:00.960 --> 32:02.660
It's Zhang Haixia's handwriting.

32:02.660 --> 32:07.480
[Mirror Lodge] [Mighty Lodge]

32:03.850 --> 32:05.130
He's warning me

32:05.310 --> 32:07.640
about the dangers hidden in each crevice.

32:07.880 --> 32:09.620
It seems he knew I was coming

32:10.250 --> 32:11.880
and deliberately left this for me.

32:11.880 --> 32:13.440
So this isn't his first time here.

32:13.440 --> 32:15.360
He even killed your mentor.

32:15.530 --> 32:18.070
Do you really think he'd be kind enough
to leave you clues?

32:18.070 --> 32:19.200
Can that be trusted?

32:19.700 --> 32:21.000
But he didn't hurt you.

32:21.370 --> 32:24.800
[Mirror Lodge] [Mighty Lodge]

32:21.790 --> 32:22.570
Maybe

32:22.680 --> 32:24.940
he really left some useful clues inside.

32:25.420 --> 32:26.810
What if he set a trap?

32:27.480 --> 32:28.960
He even killed his own mentor.

32:28.960 --> 32:32.020
Who knows—he might end up
killing Zhang Hailou as well.

32:35.440 --> 32:36.290
Although I don't know

32:36.290 --> 32:38.020
where he got this information,

32:38.810 --> 32:39.750
I think

32:40.240 --> 32:42.240
he's trying to stall us and buy time.

32:43.080 --> 32:44.480
So we might as well burn it

32:44.850 --> 32:47.030
and not waste time thinking about it.

32:53.380 --> 32:55.840
Zhang Haixia is very good at
anti-tracking.

32:56.070 --> 32:58.530
He'll erase all the traces
he leaves behind.

32:58.980 --> 32:59.790
Snake Master,

33:00.050 --> 33:01.910
can your snakes pick up his scent?

33:02.270 --> 33:02.940
Let me try.

33:18.250 --> 33:20.390
Every crevice has the smell of
someone having entered,

33:20.390 --> 33:22.090
but the traces are all very faint.

33:22.090 --> 33:23.480
That's Zhang Haixia's style.

33:23.480 --> 33:24.450
Let's split up and search.

33:24.450 --> 33:25.500
It'll be faster.

33:26.380 --> 33:27.550
Once you find Zhang Haixia,

33:27.550 --> 33:29.480
kill him immediately if possible.

33:30.060 --> 33:31.590
Otherwise, he'll kill you.

33:32.740 --> 33:34.250
Snake charmer, up ahead.

33:34.920 --> 33:35.530
Let's go.

33:35.530 --> 33:36.060
Let's go.

33:36.200 --> 33:36.660
Yes.

33:47.770 --> 33:49.230
Why are there so many jars?

33:50.830 --> 33:51.830
It really stinks.

33:53.480 --> 33:55.480
Looks like pickled vegetable jars.

34:03.850 --> 34:05.380
They've been dead for a while.

34:05.380 --> 34:06.710
Not Zhang Haixia's men.

34:07.140 --> 34:09.199
Probably villagers who wandered in.

34:09.980 --> 34:11.960
There are toxic spots. Died of poisoning.

34:11.960 --> 34:13.090
I heard

34:13.460 --> 34:15.940
that a long time ago in Nanqiang,
there was a custom

34:15.940 --> 34:17.150
where people would use

34:17.150 --> 34:18.750
slaves as human sacrifices.

34:19.130 --> 34:21.130
After blood rituals, they would be
placed into jars

34:21.130 --> 34:22.530
as offerings to the gods.

34:22.980 --> 34:25.239
So what's inside here are all offerings—

34:25.380 --> 34:26.580
human bones and such.

34:31.650 --> 34:32.800
I feel like I've seen

34:33.260 --> 34:35.520
this kind of pattern in some file before.

34:41.630 --> 34:42.820
Why do you think these people

34:42.820 --> 34:44.920
all died in the same position?

34:56.860 --> 34:58.630
These jars contain a deadly poison.

34:58.630 --> 34:59.830
It seems these people

35:00.000 --> 35:03.260
all died from inhaling the toxic gas
coming out of the jars.

35:06.650 --> 35:08.910
If they knew there was poison in the jars,

35:09.420 --> 35:10.940
why would they still lean in to inhale?

35:10.940 --> 35:11.960
Two possibilities.

35:11.960 --> 35:14.590
One is that they committed
a collective suicide.

35:14.590 --> 35:15.250
The other is

35:16.280 --> 35:17.960
that there must be something
in these crevices

35:17.960 --> 35:19.160
forcing them to do it.

35:20.290 --> 35:21.550
Keep your eyes peeled.

35:56.590 --> 35:57.440
Don't you feel

35:58.110 --> 35:59.110
it's a bit stuffy?

36:02.710 --> 36:04.360
Probably the air is too thin.

36:07.860 --> 36:09.390
Having trouble breathing?

36:11.360 --> 36:11.820
Come on.

36:32.390 --> 36:33.630
It seems these people all died

36:33.630 --> 36:35.430
because of oxygen deprivation,

36:35.760 --> 36:38.400
and they tried to breathe the air
inside the jars,

36:38.400 --> 36:40.130
but the jars contained poison.

36:40.690 --> 36:42.490
We need to pass through quickly.

36:52.710 --> 36:53.300
Qianjun.

36:55.490 --> 36:56.350
Zhang Qianjun.

37:28.340 --> 37:29.840
All I exhale is carbon dioxide.

37:29.840 --> 37:31.370
I can't hold on for too long.

37:31.820 --> 37:33.080
Move through quickly.

39:10.380 --> 39:12.760
You killed Zhang Haixia,

39:13.800 --> 39:15.610
and now you've killed me too.

39:16.340 --> 39:17.510
Are you satisfied?

39:18.380 --> 39:19.320
Mentor.

39:21.920 --> 39:22.900
Do you

39:25.000 --> 39:26.120
regret it?

39:27.880 --> 39:28.590
If...

39:29.440 --> 39:31.300
Of course, you hate "if" the most.

39:35.800 --> 39:36.840
Then I might as well...

39:36.840 --> 39:38.930
Might as well end all of this.

39:39.150 --> 39:40.750
As long as you come over here,

39:41.260 --> 39:42.740
you can atone for your sins.
